<title>USA: Collierville, Tenn., $12.200 mln won by First Tenn.</title>
<headline>Collierville, Tenn., $12.200 mln won by First Tenn.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee Bank, Memphis said it won $12.200 million of Collierville, Tenn., water and sewer system revenue and tax bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.586 percent.</p>
</text>
